  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the air fryer basket to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Add the garlic, onion, and red bell pepper to the air fryer basket and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the shiitake mushrooms to the air fryer basket and cook for 7 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the cilantro, lime juice, soy sauce, and chili flakes.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "If using Venezuelan Creole Sauce, stir it in and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Enjoy!"
